  "guideContent": {
    "strategyOverview": "Golgari reanimation engine that accumulates experience counters through sacrifice, then uses Meren's end-step trigger to return creatures from graveyard to hand or battlefield. Early turns deploy mana dorks and self-mill creatures to fill the graveyard while building XP. Mid-game establishes sacrifice loops with Spore Frog for protection and Sakura-Tribe Elder for ramp. Late-game recurs Gray Merchant of Asphodel and Kokusho for massive life drain, or casts Living Death to reanimate an entire graveyard at once. Grave Pact locks opponents out of creatures while Blood Artist drains incrementally with every death."
  },
